---

<section id="closing" class="scene" data-scene="closing" data-pin="150" data-chapter-name="Why">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="reveal glass max-w-2xl px-6 py-12 sm:px-12 sm:py-14">
      <p class="label label-mark">Why a person, not just a prompt</p>
      <h2 class="mt-8 text-5xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl" data-split>Experience decides what to <em>build.</em></h2>
      <p class="mt-10 text-lg sm:text-xl leading-relaxed max-w-[52ch] text-muted">
        AI writes code fast, and I use it every day. It does not know your business, what breaks in production at night, or which shortcut costs you a year later.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg sm:text-xl leading-relaxed max-w-[52ch] text-muted">
